#: ../../talk/chat.rst:3
msgid "Sending messages"
msgstr "Send beskeder"

#: ../../talk/chat.rst:6
msgid "Using Markdown"
msgstr "Brug af Markdown"

#: ../../talk/chat.rst:8
msgid ""
"You can enhance your messages using Markdown syntax. Supported elements:"
msgstr ""
"Du kan formatere dine beskeder med Markdown. Disse elementer understøttes:"

#: ../../talk/chat.rst:10
msgid "**Headings and dividers**"
msgstr "**Overskrifter og skillelinjer**"

#: ../../talk/chat.rst:27
msgid "**Inline decorations**"
msgstr "**Tekstformatering i linjen**"

#: ../../talk/chat.rst:40
msgid "**Lists**"
msgstr "**Lister**"

#: ../../talk/chat.rst:51
msgid "**Quotes**"
msgstr "**Citater**"

#: ../../talk/chat.rst:58
msgid "**Task lists**"
msgstr "**Opgavelister**"

#: ../../talk/chat.rst:65
msgid "**Tables**"
msgstr "**Tabeller**"

#: ../../talk/chat.rst:74
msgid "Inserting emoji"
msgstr "Indsæt emoji"

#: ../../talk/chat.rst:76
msgid ""
"You can add emoji using the picker on the left of the text input field."
msgstr "Du kan tilføje emoji med vælgeren til venstre for tekstfeltet."

#: ../../talk/chat.rst:78
msgid "Talk chat emoji picker panel"
msgstr "Panelet med emoji-vælgeren i chatten i Talk"

#: ../../talk/chat.rst:83
msgid "Smart Picker"
msgstr "Smart Picker"

#: ../../talk/chat.rst:85
msgid ""
"The smart picker makes it easier to insert links, files, or other content "
"into your conversations. Just choose the type of content you want to insert "
"(files, Talk conversations, Deck cards, GIFs, etc.). You can also type `/` "
"in the chat input to open the selector."
msgstr ""
"Med Smart Picker er det lettere at indsætte links, filer og andet indhold i "
"dine samtaler. Vælg bare, hvilken type indhold du vil indsætte (filer, Talk-"
"samtaler, Deck-kort, GIF'er osv.). Du kan også skrive `/` i tekstfeltet for "
"at åbne vælgeren."

#: ../../talk/chat.rst:89
msgid "Talk smart picker opened with slash command for inserting objects"
msgstr ""
"Smart Picker i Talk, åbnet med skråstreg-kommandoen for at indsætte indhold"

#: ../../talk/chat.rst:93
msgid ""
"Several integration apps can extend the Smart Picker with additional content"
" types, such as GitHub and GitLab issues, Giphy GIFs, and more. Ask your "
"administrator which integrations are available on your instance."
msgstr ""
"Flere integrationsapps kan udvide Smart Picker med andre typer indhold, "
"f.eks. issues fra GitHub og GitLab, GIF'er fra Giphy og mere. Spørg din "
"administrator, hvilke integrationer der findes på din instans."

#: ../../talk/chat.rst:96
msgid "Replying to messages and more"
msgstr "Svar på beskeder og mere"

#: ../../talk/chat.rst:98
msgid ""
"You can reply to a message using the arrow that appears when you hover a "
"message."
msgstr ""
"Du kan svare på en besked med pilen, der vises, når du holder markøren over "
"beskeden."

#: ../../talk/chat.rst:100
msgid "Talk chat message with the reply arrow highlighted on hover"
msgstr ""
"Besked i chatten i Talk med svarpilen fremhævet, når markøren er over den"

#: ../../talk/chat.rst:104
msgid ""
"In the ``...`` menu you can also choose to reply privately. This will open a"
" one-to-one conversation."
msgstr ""
"I menuen ``...`` kan du også vælge at svare privat. Så åbnes en samtale "
"mellem jer to."

#: ../../talk/chat.rst:106
msgid "Talk chat message context menu with reply and other options"
msgstr ""
"Genvejsmenuen for en besked i chatten i Talk med svar og andre muligheder"

#: ../../talk/chat.rst:110
msgid ""
"Here you can also create a direct link to the message or mark it unread so "
"you will scroll back there next time you enter the chat. When it is a file, "
"you can view the file in Files."
msgstr ""
"Her kan du også lave et direkte link til beskeden eller markere den som "
"ulæst, så du kommer tilbage til den, næste gang du åbner chatten. Hvis det "
"er en fil, så kan du åbne den i Filer."

#: ../../talk/chat.rst:113
msgid "Silent messages"
msgstr "Lydløse beskeder"

#: ../../talk/chat.rst:115
msgid ""
"If you don't want to disturb anyone in the middle of the night, there is a "
"silent mode for chatting. While it is enabled, other participants will not "
"receive notifications from your messages."
msgstr ""
"Hvis du ikke vil forstyrre nogen midt om natten, så kan du chatte lydløst. "
"Når det er slået til, får de andre deltagere ikke notifikationer om dine "
"beskeder."

#: ../../talk/chat.rst:118
msgid "Talk chat input with silent message option enabled"
msgstr "Tekstfeltet i chatten i Talk med lydløs besked slået til"

#: ../../talk/chat.rst:123
msgid "Scheduling messages"
msgstr "Planlæg beskeder"

#: ../../talk/chat.rst:125
msgid ""
"If you want to send a message not right now, but at a specific time, you can"
" schedule it. Just select the desired date and time in the quick actions "
"next to the input field."
msgstr ""
"Hvis du vil sende en besked senere på et bestemt tidspunkt, så kan du "
"planlægge den. Vælg dato og klokkeslæt i de hurtige handlinger ved siden af "
"tekstfeltet."

#: ../../talk/chat.rst:127
msgid "Talk message compose area with schedule send option"
msgstr "Skrivefeltet i Talk med muligheden for at planlægge afsendelse"

#: ../../talk/chat.rst:131
msgid ""
"You can find all your scheduled messages by clicking on the clock icon next "
"to the input field. There you can edit, reschedule or delete currently "
"prepared messages."
msgstr ""
"Alle dine planlagte beskeder finder du ved at klikke på urikonet ved siden "
"af tekstfeltet. Her kan du redigere, flytte eller slette de beskeder, der "
"venter."

#: ../../talk/chat.rst:133
msgid "Talk navigation bar with clock icon to view scheduled messages"
msgstr "Navigationen i Talk med urikonet til at se planlagte beskeder"

#: ../../talk/chat.rst:138
msgid "Chat summary"
msgstr "Opsummering af chatten"

#: ../../talk/chat.rst:140
msgid ""
"When AI assistant is enabled, a summary can be generated for a conversation "
"if there are more than 100 unread messages. You can generate it by pressing "
"the button that is visible in chat above the first unread messages."
msgstr ""
"Hvis AI-assistenten er slået til, kan der laves en opsummering af en "
"samtale, når der er mere end 100 ulæste beskeder. Du laver den med knappen, "
"der vises i chatten over de første ulæste beskeder."

#: ../../talk/chat.rst:143
msgid "Talk chat view with the AI summary generation button visible"
msgstr "Chatvisning i Talk med knappen til at lave en AI-opsummering"

#: ../../talk/chat.rst:147
msgid "Talk AI-generated chat summary displayed in the conversation"
msgstr "AI-genereret opsummering af chatten i en samtale i Talk"
